<title>USA: Apex PC solutions files 3.0 mln shr offer.</title>
<headline>Apex PC solutions files 3.0 mln shr offer.</headline>
<dateline>WOODINVILLE, Wash. 1997-07-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Apex PC Solutions Inc Monday announced it has registered with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission to sell 3.0 million common shares.</p>
<p>Of the stock being sold, 1.0 million shares are being offered by the company and 2.0 million by selling shareholders.</p>
<p>Montgomery Securities, Dain Bosworth Inc and Cowen &amp; Company are the underwriters of this offering.</p>
